{"unit_id":"Johnly1986__AmberFlow#feature-1","repo":"Johnly1986/AmberFlow","commit":"c0abb39db8c9e93c047c2f070266f5e121f42c8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"AmberFlow 的功能「列出并筛选流程应用」：工具查询用户范围内的流程应用，返回应用标识、目标、路径及允许访问的主机。 通过对应的 DSH 工具触发，输入应用标识、网页地址或动作脚本，产出列表、检查结果、运行摘要或流程应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["integrations/dsh-bridge/src/index.ts:318-386","integrations/dsh-bridge/src/service.ts:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"Johnly1986__AmberFlow#feature-2","repo":"Johnly1986/AmberFlow","commit":"c0abb39db8c9e93c047c2f070266f5e121f42c8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"AmberFlow 的功能「观察网页」：提供页面 URL、标题、可交互元素和可选文本摘要，便于为流程编写目标提示。 通过对应的 DSH 工具触发，输入应用标识、网页地址或动作脚本，产出列表、检查结果、运行摘要或流程应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["integrations/dsh-bridge/src/index.ts:815-881","integrations/dsh-bridge/src/service.ts:1-20"]}
